<title>BELARUS: Belarus Feb industrial output up 5.2 pct vs Jan.</title>
<headline>Belarus Feb industrial output up 5.2 pct vs Jan.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial output in Belarus grew by 5.2 percent in February to stand 11.2 percent higher than a year earlier, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Growth over the first two months against the previous year</p>
<p>was 12.3 percent, it said.</p>
<p> BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Feb 97     Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> month/month			 +5.2	 0.0	  +2.7</p>
<p> year/year			  +11.2     +14.0	  -5.4</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38 044-229-2264</p>
</text>
